<title>HUNGARY: Hungary O/N rates ease to 24.00 pct, keen interest.</title>
<headline>Hungary O/N rates ease to 24.00 pct, keen interest.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's overnight interbank rates closed down at 24.00 percent in hectic trade on Thursday and dealers said the rate could slip a bit further tomorrow.</p>
<p>&quot;It was hectic...and there was a lot of demand for prices,&quot; said Balazs Varga of Inter-Europa Bank. &quot;Tomorrow the interbank rate should be even lower than today.&quot;</p>
<p>The rate was down slightly from Wednesday's close of 24.375 percent.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom ++ 36 1 327 4040</p>
